nt spaces, and any environment where mood plays a role in the overall experience. A room that feels better is often a room people remember longer.    If your space needs a feature that adds atmosphere, motion, and a stronger emotional presence, we can help design a\u0026nbsp;rain curtain\u0026nbsp;that fits the room with purpose. Contact us at Midwest Tropical to discuss a custom Rain Curtain water feature for your project.",
